2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T16:08:59-07:00","id":1247205,"title":"","content":"What powers do the fair folk possess in the scion bestiary?<br /> could you expand on the process of taking a role that a scion can do once he becomes a god?<br /> you mentioned before about the Keepers Of The World,who plan to seal the world from gods, I was wondering do the Keepers plan to be the only gods in the world so they can rule it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T16:22:37-07:00","id":1247211,"title":"","content":"At what point are we likely to start seeing settings other than the World? Will it not be until after Demigod and God have both come out?<br /> <br /> Can you tell us anything about a few of the other settings you have planned?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T16:27:51-07:00","id":1247215,"title":"","content":"Since all the Pantheons need to be expanded with each power upgrade (at very least for their Pantheon Specific Purviews), are there plans for handling that for the Demigod and God upgrades for the Yazata and Nemetondevos, or the God upgrades for the Pantheons to be introduced in the Demigod book?<br /> <br /> Any word on when the community content platform on Drivethrurpg will go live?<br /> <br /> Will it be possible for Incarnate Scions of living deities to exist? This seems to be how the Deva largely operate, though they reabsorb the new Mantle when it achieves Godhood. On the other hand, it might be how gods that start as cultural variants of another god become independent deities, a Mantle spinning off to Incarnate itself. Am I on the right track here?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T18:42:13-07:00","id":1247258,"title":"","content":"Are the Hopi Kachinas among your planned pantheons?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13079-wannabe-demon-lord","name":"Wannabe Demon Lord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-18T20:24:39-07:00","id":1247597,"title":"","content":"Why are you so damn handsome?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T06:39:29-07:00","id":1247680,"title":"","content":"Ad you go up in Tiers will you Boons get upgraded in power? I ask this because your boon amount is locked at legend+1 and while many of the Hero boons are powerful compared to what you would think Gods would have many do seem short. Also can Booms get exchanged? From what I've seen I think no but when looking at the Gods with a shit ton of purviews I wonder if that means they are actually more limited at specific powers then I would have thought.<br /> <br /> Do Titan's really have just one purview or is the one listed just the one that influences them? Do Titan's have legend similar to Gods and are their any other differences that you can reveal this early tho I doubt it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-22T22:02:51-07:00","id":1248818,"title":"","content":"Will the bestiary introduce new Denizen Paths? I\u2019m particularly wondering about playable alfar/sidhe/etc or dwarves?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a h